## 💻 TECHNICAL PROJECTS
### **Privacy Pulse — Enterprise-Grade Productivity Analytics Engine**
*Designed and engineered an optimization utility that tracks system telemetry to map user focus and enforce data privacy at the operating system layer.*

* **System Architecture**: Built using a strict Separation of Concerns model; decoupled the front-end layout engine (`app.py`) from the low-level operating system hooks (`core.py`).
* **AI & Vibe Coding Workflow**: Utilized Large Language Models (LLMs) to accelerate structural code generation while manually auditing system architecture to ensure modular file layouts.
* **Security Layer**: Developed a context-aware threat filter using dynamic string parsing to intercept and sanitize sensitive active process titles, automatically purging Personally Identifiable Information (PII) before storage.
* **UI/UX Engineering**: Applied custom CSS injections to render a responsive, radial-gradient dark interface featuring dynamic state indicator elements and real-time analytical time-series charts.

